{"unit_id":"tag:0EW3:proof-002","translation":"第二种证明<PROOFARGEND_0001>由引理<REF_0001>，这些上同调群（cohomology groups）是<MATH_0001>的上同调（cohomology），以某个复形（complex）为值，该复形由阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）组成，定义在景（site）<MATH_0002>上。（即导出范畴（derived category）的对象（object）<MATH_0003>，见上面的引理<REF_0002>，并回顾<MATH_0004>。）由平坦性（Flatness）续论引理<REF_0003>，可表示（representable）预层（presheaves）图（diagram）的 ph 层化（sheafification）是余笛卡尔（cocartesian）的。因此，此引理由十分一般的景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）引理<REF_0004>得到，将它应用于景（site）<MATH_0005>及本引理的交换图（commutative diagram）即可。\n","allowed_english":["ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"Flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表示"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"cocartesian","target_term":"余笛卡尔"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Flatness","target_term":"平坦性","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表示","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":